  // What is built of Hoenn so far (plan 21). The maps are Emerald's, read by tools/MapImporter's GBA reader
  // (plan 18 · W6, W7: --game emerald); "maps" are the maps the game makes from its matrices, "areas" the areas
  // open to walk in. After adding an area, run `dotnet run --project tools/MapImporter -- --game emerald --data`
  // and write its overlay (overlays/<key>.json). A room is a matrix of its own built from its layout ("Indoors").
  // The sea floor (Emerald's underwater maps, which the reader keeps as matrices of their own for now) is plan 21 · H5's.
